@startuml sequence-agent
' The assistant asks before it changes anything.
title AI assistant — it always asks before changing data

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #55606E
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBorderColor #9AA5B1
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F7F9FB
  LifeLineBorderColor #C3CCD6
}

actor User
participant "ERP app" as APP
participant "AI service" as AI
participant "Local AI model" as LLM

User -> APP : "Add a customer called Fatma"
APP -> AI : the question + who is asking
AI -> LLM : what should I do?
LLM --> AI : "create a customer"

note over AI
  This would change data,
  so the assistant stops here.
end note

AI --> APP : Please confirm
APP --> User : Create customer "Fatma"?\n[ Approve ]  [ Reject ]

User -> APP : Approve
APP -> AI : approved
AI -> APP : create the customer\n(using the user's own account)
APP --> AI : done
AI --> APP : "Customer Fatma created"
APP --> User : "Customer Fatma created"

note over APP
  The assistant goes through the same
  API a person uses, signed in as that
  person — so it can never do anything
  the user is not allowed to do.
  Every action it takes is logged.
end note

@enduml
